+
+## Class-mapping rules
+
+Use daisyUI components plus plain CSS. Do not rely on Tailwind utility classes in these static CDN previews; the phase-2 spike showed they silently fail without the app build.
+
+| Bespoke / app pattern | Static preview pattern |
+| --- | --- |
+| `btn btn--primary` | `btn btn-primary` |
+| `btn btn--secondary` | `btn btn-soft` |
+| `btn btn--ghost` | `btn btn-ghost` |
+| `btn btn--color-error` | `btn btn-error` |
+| `btn--lg` / `btn--sm` | `btn-lg` / `btn-sm` |
+| `pill p-ok` | `badge badge-success badge-soft` |
+| `pill p-info` | `badge badge-info badge-soft` |
+| `pill p-warn` | `badge badge-warning badge-soft` |
+| `pill p-bad` | `badge badge-error badge-soft` |
+| `statpill--ok` / `spill--active` | `badge badge-success badge-soft` |
+| `statpill--bad` / `spill--paused` | `badge badge-warning badge-soft` |
+| `spill--trial` | `badge badge-info badge-soft` |
+| `spill--bounced` | `badge badge-error badge-soft` |
+| `role role--lead/base/safe` | `badge` plus primary/neutral/info soft variants, or a small CSS-only role-chip wrapper if needed for fidelity. |
+| `input` / `textarea` | daisyUI `input` / `textarea` |
+| `field` / `field__label` / `field__hint` | `fieldset`, `label`, `fieldset-label`, or equivalent plain CSS when a shipped app form needs exact spacing. |
+| `av` / `av--sm` / `av--lg` | `avatar avatar-placeholder` only if it renders via daisyUI CDN; otherwise plain CSS initials circles. |
+
+For layout, write local classes such as `.invite-shell`, `.profile-card`, or `.progress-step` in the preview `<style>` block instead of Tailwind utilities like `flex`, `gap-4`, `w-full`, `text-sm`, or `rounded-xl`.
